      "snippet_id": "SNP-001",
      "snippet_text": "\"I bought a yearly subscription (finishing January 31st 2026) for $227.05 to a content provider called Chasing Bourbon. Patreon decided to take this content provider off their platform for their own decision/policy and now they refuse to reimburse me for the unused portion or $75.63. I happened to know the content provider and they are not paying him either so Patreon is just keeping my money. I want my money back since they are not providing the service that they terminated at their own decision\"",
